OL,3,GNEWSALosing my legs ended my football
OL,4,Adream - now skiing gives me freedom
OL,5,
OL,6,FA promising footballer who lost both
OL,7,Flegs after a car crash has a new
OL,8,Fpassion in life - after finding
OL,9,F"freedom" in skiing.
OL,11,FAdam Golebiewski was only 17 when the
OL,12,Fcrash happened in 2024 in Macduff,
OL,13,FAberdeenshire. He needed a double
OL,14,Famputation below the knee.
OL,16,FThe former goalkeeper celebrated his
OL,17,F18th birthday during his rehabilitation
OL,18,Fin hospital, and was fitted for
OL,19,Fprosthetics.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
