OL,3,GNEWSALosing my legs ended my football
OL,4,Adream - now skiing gives me freedom
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince then he has become a father, and
OL,7,F- now aged 20 - is showing a flair for
OL,8,Fpara cross-country skiing. Adam's coach
OL,9,Fthinks the Parlaympic Winter Games
OL,10,Fcould be a target.
